  "description": "The PC lens features higher transmittance than other materials,which provides a clearer & brighter lighting so that you can enjoy a pleasant & safe drive.\nFitment\n2014 - 2021 Toyota Tundra\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: Headlights assembly compatible with 2014 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 2000 2021 Toyota Tundra. High beam: H11, low beam: HB3, bulbs are not included\nEnhanced Visibility & Safety: LED headlights make your vehicle more conspicuous during the day, while the projector lens delivers a stronger, concentrated beam at night. You'll see better and be seen better in all driving conditions\nWaterproof Design: fully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries in sorts of weather conditions\nImpact Resistance: Impact-resistant polycarbonate lens absorbs shocks from gravel and potholes. Reinforced housing dampens vibration for long-lasting structural integrity\nEasy to Install: No modification, no cutting, or no drilling needed. The headlight assembly looks and functions like the stock headlights; professional installation would be highly recommended",
